        "snippet": "Sabre (NASDAQ:SABR) Issues Quarterly Earnings Results, Beats Estimates By $0.11 EPS - The Cerbat Gem\n\n# Sabre (NASDAQ:SABR) Issues Quarterly Earnings Results, Beats Estimates By $0.11 EPS\n\nPosted by Teresa Graham on May 8th, 2026\n\nShare on Twitter Share on Facebook Share on LinkedIn Share on Stocktwits\n\nSabre (NASDAQ:SABR– Get Free Report) issued its quarterly earnings data on Thursday. The information technology services provider reported $0.06 earnings per share for the quarter, topping the consensus estimate of ($0.05) by $0.11, FiscalAI reports. The company had revenue of $760.33 million for the quarter, compared to the consensus estimate of $739.02 million.\n\nHere are the key takeaways from Sabre’s conference call:\n\nGet Sabre alerts:\n\n- Q1 outperformance: Revenue grew ~8% and Normalized Adjusted EBITDA rose 21% to $169 million, with margin expansion of roughly 235 basis points to ~22%, beating prior guidance.\n- Middle East and fuel headwinds: Sabre said ~11% of air bookings touch t",
